<BaseLayout title="About — Alex Franquelli" description="About Alex Franquelli, writer and media professional based between Rome and London.">
  <div class="simple">
    <div class="eyebrow">About</div>
    <h1>Alex Franquelli</h1>
    <p>I am a writer and media professional based between Rome and London. I have written about music, politics and culture for publications including The Quietus, PopMatters, All About Jazz, The Line of Best Fit, openDemocracy and OndaRock.</p>
    <p>This site is an archive of that work: reviews, interviews, live reports and longer features in English and Italian, stretching back to the mid-2000s.</p>
    <p>Alongside writing, I work in media planning and buying in London. I also write fiction and am finishing my first novel.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
